&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At OpenUp, our mission is to make mental well-being accessible to everyone. Following a ‘high tech &amp;amp; high touch’ approach, we support companies, their employees, and their families with proactive and practical mental health services. Through our digital platform, clients can access 1:1 check-ins, online courses, articles, videos, group sessions, mindfulness practices, and a team of committed mental well-being experts. As we believe that mental and physical well-being are deeply connected, we have also added Lifestyle Experts to our offering, focusing on nutrition, exercise, and sleep. We offer a truly holistic approach that helps people take ownership of their health. We’re proud to work with forward-thinking organizations and are committed to raising the bar on accessible care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OpenUp was ranked in the Top 3 on LinkedIn’s Top Startups list for 2023, 2024 &amp;amp; 2025 and is continuously growing. We are expanding our international teams and we are searching for like-minded talent. We are already serving 2000+ companies (e.g. Rituals, Deloitte, Decathlon, KPMG, and McDonalds), through which 600K+ employees have access to our product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building out our presence in the DACH market and are looking for an entrepreneurial, purpose driven Sales Director to lead this market with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you take full ownership of our commercial success in DACH. You coach and develop our Account Executives, shape our go to market strategy, and act as our trusted advisor on the German market for the wider organisation. This is not a &quot;manage and report&quot; role; it&#39;s an opportunity to build a market from the ground up and lead from the front, including closing deals yourself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work closely with our Business Development, Customer Success, and Marketing teams as part of a collaborative, international commercial team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the go to market strategy for the DACH region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach, develop, and grow a team of Account Executives (currently scaling from 2 to 6)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and expand the market, including new B2B partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the internal advisor and voice of the German market for our (Dutch) headquarters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take full ownership of the DACH sales function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close deals yourself, staying hands on and close to the market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You genuinely enjoy working with people; you&#39;re energised by conversations, coaching your team, and building relationships at different levels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You bring a combination of drive, curiosity, and resilience. You take ownership, learn from setbacks, and continuously look for ways to improve. You&#39;re comfortable operating in a fast paced, still to be built environment and enjoy being part of a team that builds together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mental well being resonates with you as something that matters and something you want to contribute to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of leadership experience in B2B SaaS or tech sales, ideally within HR SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine hunter mentality and a strong instinct for go to market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or scaling a market or sales team from the ground up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enthusiasm for staying personally involved in closing deals, not just leading from behind&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of the German market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ambition paired with a warm, human way of leading people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you can expect&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining OpenUp means being part of a fast-growing company that&#39;s doing something meaningful. You&#39;ll work with a diverse and international team. We like to have fun together with a lot of team building activities like our weekly ‘borrels’ and after work sport classes, the yearly ski-trip and our Padel tournament. Which makes our work fun, challenging and dynamic. Apart from this, we offer:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;€1500 annual personal development budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ClassPass: OpenUp contributes towards your classpass membership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly home internet/phone contribution (50EUR)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily healthy and vegetarian lunch at our Amsterdam office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular office yoga, meditation classes or breathing exercises (at our Amsterdam office)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work model (hybrid and options for remote work).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly drinks and company wide summer fest and other fun activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;27.5 vacation days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free and unlimited access for you and your family to all our products, including our psychologists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inspired to be part of OpenUp? We’d love to hear your story. Apply via our website and we’ll get in touch soon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have questions, please visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://openup.com/nl/veelgestelde-vragen/&quot;&gt;FAQ page&lt;/a&gt; or reach out directly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At OpenUp, everyone is welcome to apply regardless of age, gender, background, nationality, or any other characteristic. What matters to us is high performance, a real drive to make an impact and the ambition to become the European market leader. If you&#39;re ready to OpenUp, join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to streamline parts of our recruitment process. These tools assist our recruitment team but do not replace human judgement. All hiring decisions are made by humans. If you would like more information about how we use AI in the process, please contact us.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;At OpenUp, we believe mental well-being should be as accessible and normal as going to the gym. Our mission is simple but ambitious: to make mental well-being available to everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We partner with companies to support their employees and families through proactive, practical mental health services. Our platform brings together 1:1 check-ins, courses, content, group sessions, and mindfulness practices - all supported by a dedicated network of experts. We take a holistic view, connecting mental and physical well-being through lifestyle coaching focused on sleep, nutrition, and exercise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, we support over 1,500 companies and 500,000+ employees globally, including Rituals, Deloitte, Decathlon, KPMG, and McDonald’s. Recognised as a Top 3 LinkedIn Startup in 2023, 2024 and 2025 - and we&#39;ve got big plans to keep growing our client-base, which is where this role comes into play.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We’re growing our presence in the DACH market and are looking for entrepreneurial, purpose-driven Account Executives to help build this market with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;In this role, you own the full sales cycle end-to-end - from identifying opportunities and opening conversations, through to closing deals and building long-term relationships. This is not a “plug-and-play” sales role; it’s an opportunity to shape how we grow in DACH.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You’ll work closely with our Business Development, Customer Success, and Marketing teams as part of a collaborative, international commercial team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive new business by identifying and engaging potential clients across the DACH region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and expand a strong network of B2B partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow existing accounts by spotting expansion opportunities (including international rollouts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted first point of contact for your customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to our team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You genuinely enjoy working with people; you’re energised by conversations, building relationships, and connecting with stakeholders at different levels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You bring a combination of drive, curiosity, and resilience. You take ownership, learn from setbacks, and continuously look for ways to improve. You’re comfortable operating in a fast-paced environment and enjoy being part of a team that builds together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Mental well-being resonates with you as something that matters and something you want to contribute to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in sales (ideally B2B SaaS or high-growth environments)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong relationship-building skills - you’re a natural, confident and engaging networker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience - or interest - in building a network within HR or People teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in closing deals with medium- to large-enterprises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured, action-oriented way of working and a relationship-focussed sales approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enthusiasm for working in a highly dynamic, AI-forward international environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with tools like Salesforce, HubSpot, or Pipedrive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent language skills in both German and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get as part of our team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You’ll join a company that combines commercial ambition with meaningful impact. We move fast, support each other, and make time to celebrate along the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Alongside a competitive salary and bonus structure, we offer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;€1500 annual personal development budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribution to your ClassPass membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;€50 monthly internet/phone allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily healthy, vegetarian lunch at the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular yoga, meditation, and breathing sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible hybrid working model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly drinks, summer events, ski trips, and padel tournaments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;27.5 vacation days per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free and unlimited access to OpenUp for you and your family, including sessions with psychologists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
